{"id":"bisher","lemma":"bisher","pos":"adv","rank":699,"glosses":["so far, until now, as yet"],"ipa":"/bɪsˈheːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4d/De-at-bisher.ogg/De-at-bisher.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Bisher gab es da keine Probleme.","en":"There have been no problems so far.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718106","words":[null,{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"problem","l":"Problem"}]},{"text":"Was ist bisher passiert?","en":"What's happened so far?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Bisher hat mich noch niemand umgebracht.","en":"Nobody's killed me yet.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to kill","l":"umbringen"}]},{"text":"Wie ist dein Wochenende bisher gewesen?","en":"How's your weekend been so far?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"weekend"},null,{"g":"former"}]},{"text":"Du hast bisher sehr wenig gesagt.","en":"You've said very little so far.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"little, few"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]}]}